# Orquestrador dnd-api

Docs: [`docs/architecture/infrastructure.md`](../../docs/architecture/infrastructure.md) · [`docs/architecture/architecture.md`](../../docs/architecture/architecture.md)

Genérico: shared-ai (`nestjs`, `typeorm`, `jest`, `testing`, `sql`, `postgres`, `supabase`, `vercel`, `rest-api`).

## Skills locais

| Quando | Skill |
|--------|-------|
| Glossário / slugs PT-EN | `dnd-glossary-pt` |
| Tabelas, FKs, views PHB | `rpg-catalog-model` |
| Queries prontas nas views | `phb-query-views` |
| `db:setup` / migrate / seed | `postgres-apply-catalog` |
| Classe mesa (table-action / economy) | `rpg-class-mesa-api` |
| Arquivos grandes / dívida | `audit-code-health` |
| Split SRP de módulo TS | `split-large-module` |

## Rules locais

`architecture` · `api-contract` · `phb-data` · `file-size` · `refactor-triggers` · `docs-hub` · `class-mesa`

## Ops rápidos

- TypeORM: `schema: 'rpg'`, `synchronize: false`; pooler **6543** em prod
- JWT: `jsonwebtoken` + JWKS — sem `jose` no runtime
- Testes: `*.queries.spec.ts` / `*.application.spec.ts` / e2e; `npm run test:cov`
- Migrations: não editar aplicadas; seeds FK-safe; `dev-reset` só em dev
- Docs: índice [`docs/README.md`](../../docs/README.md); padrões [`code-standards.md`](../../docs/architecture/code-standards.md)
- Tamanho TS: soft 150 / hard **200** linhas (rule `file-size`)
